  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A source supplies heat to a system at the rate of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1000</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mo>.</mo></math> If the system performs work at a rate of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>200</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mo>.</mo></math> The rate at which internal energy of the system increases is</p>",
    "image": null
  },
